ment.mdx-device-management","Dispositivos e identidades","Registra dispositivos y controla sus identidades durante todo el ciclo de vida.","/docs/platform/pki/device-management",{"_44":207},"platform/pki/device-management.mdx",{"_19":209,"_26":27,"_21":210,"_40":211,"_30":29,"_23":212},"operar-lamassu-monitorizacion","Monitorización","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bell shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 3.464 0\"></path><path d=\"M3.262 15.326A1 1 0 0 0 4 17h16a1 1 0 0 0 .74-1.673C19.41 13.956 18 12.499 18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 4.499-1.411 5.956-2.738 7.326\"></path></svg>",[213],{"_19":214,"_26":37,"_21":215,"_31":216,"_40":-7,"_11":217,"_42":218},"platform/pki/alerts.mdx-alerts","Alertas y suscripciones","Envía eventos de la PKI a personas y sistemas externos.","/docs/platform/pki/alerts",{"_44":219},"platform/pki/alerts.mdx",{"_19":221,"_26":47,"_40":-7,"_21":222},"_3","Administrar Lamassu",{"_19":224,"_26":37,"_21":225,"_31":226,"_40":-7,"_11":227,"_42":228},"platform/pki/access-control.mdx","Control de acceso","Conecta una identidad OIDC o X.509 con principales, políticas y permisos de Lamassu.","/docs/platform/pki/access-control",{"_44":224},{"_19":230,"_26":37,"_21":231,"_31":232,"_40":-7,"_11":233,"_42":234},"platform/pki/audit-logs.mdx","Registros de auditoría","Entiende qué eventos de auditoría genera Lamassu y cómo convertirlos en una pista durable.","/docs/platform/pki/audit-logs",{"_44":230},{"_19":236,"_26":37,"_21":237,"_31":238,"_40":-7,"_11":239,"_42":240},"platform/pki/troubleshooting.mdx","Resolución de problemas","Diagnostica acceso, salud, emisión, enrolamiento y dependencias en un despliegue de Lamassu.","/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting",{"_44":236},{"_19":242,"_26":47,"_40":-7,"_21":243},"_4","Integraciones",{"_19":245,"_26":37,"